{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-19_end","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-19","title":"殷红君主","storyCode":"13-21","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-19_end.txt","sourceHash":"d172c93aa80b5bef9fd97c70d30c933d24e6a24cb5bca917412cf25a1b840394","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g3_giantmonsterspinetop"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血雨，仍只是不停地下，仿佛永远不会止息。\n\\nLogos和阿米娅的肩膀已经被雨水浸染成了红色。\n\\n白发的血魔却仿佛只是漫步在雨中，纤尘未染。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧，瞧瞧你们自己狼狈的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左支右绌，顾此失彼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕无人回应你们的号哭，也别浪费了这片舞台，别浪费了最后告别的机会。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我陈述，则为我规定。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“风雨止歇，无权流动。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在言语落定的一瞬间，血雨全数静止在了空中。\n\\n宛若帘幕，宛若星辰，折射出海的悲悯，月的光辉。\n\\n血魔大君眯了眯眼睛，仿佛并不惊异于女妖之主咒言的精妙，而只是在欣赏一件横亘于天地之间的艺术品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呵止了奔腾本身？很精彩，血为你驻足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但——我才是它们的主人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"空中悬停的血珠猛然炸开，溅射向一切可供攀附之物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丧钟会溃朽，规程将疲敝，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若你如此不屑于自己身负的高贵血脉，我会将它们抽取而出，送还给你的母亲，女妖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她会为你奏起哀悼的哨音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血魔仅仅给了阿米娅一瞬间的机会，但是已经足够。\n\\n阿米娅的手掌抵住血魔的身体，黏腻的鲜血烧灼着她的掌心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你的血吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"靠你的法术而炽热，靠你的天赋而炽热。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我所见过的热血——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——都是为了反抗，都是为了活命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些人的血，比你炽热得多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"漆黑的线条从阿米娅的掌中迸射而出，穿过血魔的身体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米娅，退回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他避开了要害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多么冷酷啊，魔王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是一位寡恩之主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔大君，鲜血王庭的主人，你的子裔填满了萨卡兹所在的每一片战场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你总向他们宣称，杀戮和征伐就是血魔古老的传统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你将自己的王庭塑造成了如今的样子。你让所有人眼中的血魔，都如你自己一般只余下扭曲的欲望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我认识的血魔，不止你一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不曾与你一样疯狂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们只是将自己的渴求隐藏得很好，他们只是被这个失去家园的时代规训得太深。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总有人选择匍匐于侵略者的脚下，我为他们遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔大君，你如何诠释自己王庭所代表的鲜血？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹的苦难何须多言，每一个萨卡兹，哪怕臣服于你们的那些，都不免饱尝血的滋味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被人掀翻在暗巷，被人堵截在密林，有时是咽喉被割断，有时则是肋骨间被刺入冰冷的匕首。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而他的兄弟姐妹也将因此得以转醒，得以明白屈服的代价，于是他们反抗，直到自己也身披敌人的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多可悲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杀死别人，或自己被人杀死，这就是萨卡兹所背负的，血的循环。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“血的循环”，这就是你所定义的，鲜血的意义？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们第一次被血沾湿身体，难道不是......从母体中诞生吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血是人们维生的根本，血是脐带连接的传承，血是探索外界时难免的磕绊，和必将愈合的伤口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你却只将它们视作折磨与死亡的代称。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的偏执使得你嗜血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以你的骄横与傲慢使他们相信，这才是萨卡兹原本就该行的道，该做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我否决你，血魔大君。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我否决你的行动，你的言语，你的王庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈！我听到了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，一个异族，否决我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"区区一顶王冠，让你膨胀到了什么地步——“魔王”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_i05_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血海翻滚，浪潮掩月。\n\\n殷红正夺去其他所有颜色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不在乎我是什么，我被称为什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，我需要做些什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"大君的动作停顿了一瞬。\n\\n声音在他的脑海中响起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你就是这么玩弄“魔王”能力的吗，卡特斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你打算说些什么大道理，又要用怎样肤浅的情感来尝试动摇我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你大可尝试。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"动摇？不。\n\\n是否定。\n翻滚的浪在减缓，伴随着月色荡漾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_i05_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我否定你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我否定你，将“魔王”，将萨卡兹，将卡兹戴尔归结为力量与传统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我否定你，把未来寄托给过去，把生命寄托于杀戮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅小姐，魔王，议长，巴别塔的领袖，曾给所有人看过一条道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也许，那条道路过于理想；也许，她的承诺承载不住萨卡兹延绵千年万年的仇恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但绝不是现在，你的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想笑我懦弱？指责我不配与你谈论萨卡兹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还是想嘲笑Logos先生此刻依然不打算借用你“唤醒”的血脉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哦，“魔王”。偷听我脑海里的思维，就是你的能耐了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你自然知晓我要说些什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我们从未说过，萨卡兹应当放弃反抗。我们从未说过，苦难理所应当。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"正相反——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_i05_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"自煎熬和苦难之中，自仇恨和深渊之中觉醒的反抗者们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"会比你强大得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹们所失落的家园，不在你一遍遍回望的、那些万年前的历史中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它不该是一句口号，一个空想，一个象征。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它就在这里，就在萨卡兹们来的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那座名为卡兹戴尔的城市里，明明就生活着如此之多真实存在的人，而你们却只将他们葬送在了一个虚无的理念里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你用过去臆想现在，那真正的未来就永远不可能降生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"停下吧，血魔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_i05_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅的戒指碎裂，飞溅。\n\\n冰冷的愤怒灼烧着阿米娅，亦审视着眼前的敌人。\n\\n阿米娅本以为这种愤怒会越发高涨，直到燃起能烧透海洋的火。\n不，并非如此。\n\\n她感觉到的却不止于怒火，还有如此凝烈的......悲伤。\n萨卡兹，失去家园之人。\n\\n是啊，萨卡兹们相信，只有以暴行和战争才能夺回他们失落的一切。\n\\n指责他们是多么容易，无非是那些沦为陈词滥调的话语，关于道德，关于公义，关于良知。\n\\n这些话已经一遍又一遍地说起，可战争还在继续，仇恨也还会蔓延。\n因为，这片大地就是这么对待他们的。\n\\n这片大地加诸他们身上的，本就是暴行与战争。\n\\n那么，以牙还牙又有什么过错？以血偿血又有什么罪恶？\n每一任魔王都如此行事，所以，战争才永不止歇。\n\\n这一切必须打破，但这一切......又该如何打破？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"连特蕾西娅都失败了，而你？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是啊，连特蕾西娅小姐都失败了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，特蕾西娅小姐才需要我。博士和凯尔希医生才需要我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我才在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如死魂灵所说的，如你所说的，如诸多萨卡兹所认为的那般——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"异族的——弱小的——“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让开吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g3_giantmonsterspinetop"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"纯黑的律令化为魔王的宣判，刺向焦灼的血。\n\\n浓郁的红终于消散——\n血魔后退了几步，抬起手，拭去了口鼻中洇出的鲜血。\n\\n他的身躯已经残损，白色的衣服也终于洒上了血色。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经没办法战斗了，血魔大君。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战斗该结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王”，你不为我赐下那虚无的愿景吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想窥知我的所思所想，我的所哀所苦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以申饬我，你可以否定我，万千萨卡兹都相信，这就是魔王的权力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你指控我败坏我的王庭，那你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王”，萨卡兹以你所指之处为路，以你所行之道为途，我的同胞们追随着你，期待你善加利用他们的血与肉，他们的生命与灵魂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种盲目的信仰，可笑至极。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对魔王的抚慰嗤之以鼻，但我......曾见过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的兄长，亦曾是魔王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王”，呵，多么尊崇的名号，多么超绝的地位——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他被视为萨卡兹的领袖，我们的道标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是天生的拯救者，他是能将我们拉出苦厄的那双手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可事实又是如何呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑色王冠所挑选的，又是怎样的一群人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在最开始，魔王确实是伟岸的，炎魔踏上谴罚之路，歌利亚咆哮无畏之灾——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可他们却总被怯懦者背叛，被自私者出卖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我们的诅咒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王......杀死了魔王。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这顶王冠的更迭，往往伴随着死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卑劣者总是胜出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"于是，王冠被愚蠢和短视污染了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王之中，开始出现软弱之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们狭隘，他们醉心于玩弄手中的权术——他们变得和神民与先民那些虚伪的领主并无不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"窃取而来的权力使他们再也无法认清自己，我的同胞们信仰的对象，也从无畏的战士，变成了躲藏在王宫里的蠹虫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们甚至忘记了——萨卡兹这个名字背负的耻辱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而王冠却还是在做出可笑的选择，直到我的兄长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以为，他会是我们久盼而来的那位英雄！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而他，居然胆敢向我声称，萨卡兹们已经无力继续承担战争，修复卡兹戴尔需要几代人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"连我们脚下这具骸骨都知道，我们该修复的卡兹戴尔绝不该是一座城市。而“魔王”，才应是站在所有人面前的那个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他这样的人，身体里怎么配容纳那一滴提卡兹的血！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到了吗，魔王！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到......一场洒满了鲜血的内乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王宫的地毯都被浸透染红。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看见，一个......血魔，倒在另一个血魔怀中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“覆血王子”的传说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他卒于一场内乱，而你是他的骨肉手足，你参与了那场叛乱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！当然不！“参与者”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仅我一人，即让王冠碎裂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我仍记得那个场面，我的手贯穿了他的胸膛。提卡兹澄澈的血在我的指尖飞舞，最终没入了我的血管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他扭头看向我，扯住我的衣服......“魔王”在死前却对行凶者展现了本该赐予功臣的虚幻愿景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那幅愿景里，我曾看见......我也曾目睹，“安宁”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正如你所说，卡特斯，鲜血不只等同于死亡。我站在山谷之间，看着一个平静的村庄，医生一边谈笑，一边为伤者缝合伤口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"受伤的人告诉医生，最近的猎物格外凶猛，但他最终还是赢下了那场搏斗。院子里，挂着新鲜收获的兽肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......而那医生就是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这让我更加怒不可遏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多么悲哀，多么虚无，多么可耻！我的兄长，居然以为，这种虚假的“安宁”就能蒙蔽我？他大错特错！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他以为我被仇恨冲昏了头脑？不，我知晓什么是平静，正因为这样，我才更加躁动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们渴望看到，真正强大的提卡兹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我将兄长的血纳入己躯，我眼看着黑色的王冠在我眼前消逝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你并未荣登“魔王”之位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我并不可惜。倘若它能选中强大的领袖，我反而由衷庆幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这顶王冠却一次又一次让我失望。更加失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我兄长的继任者是一个，流浪汉。再之后，是个樵夫。要不是赦罪师带回的卷宗，这些人，根本不配被铭记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之后的再一位入主卡兹戴尔的魔王被那只名为凯尔希的怪物杀死，倒在联军之前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随后，是特蕾西娅和特雷西斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们令人高看一眼，却又让人心生焦躁，只耽于空想的特蕾西娅白白浪费了她的强大，像极了我那......软弱的兄长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而她的继任者......居然已沦落到是一只异族的卡特斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，既然王冠的选择总是如此荒诞，它的存在却又总是给我的同胞们带去可耻的希望——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，我就在文明之外葬送它。我就让它真的彻底遗落于历史之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还在挣扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，别给他机会。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也衰弱了。也是。王冠再怎么蒙受玷污，其重量也不是你这样一个婴孩般的卡特斯所能承受的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来那些等着摆弄王冠的赦罪师们又要对我絮叨些废话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......重新看看这里吧，卡特斯。你若是死了，便不会再有任何“继任者”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，你能把你的王冠给月亮戴上吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"肆意流淌的血液涌向血魔大君的身躯。\n\\n白发的萨卡兹再次傲然立起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么......？他怎么可能还能战斗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王的术法已经深入他的身躯之内，他的躯体本应已无法再生才对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在用血填补缺失的肉身，用血缝合伤痕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他已是悬丝傀儡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在越发熟练地运用魔王的力量，卡特斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你的一切劝诫、警告、审判、宣言，都是笑话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无知的小兔子，你头顶的王冠，并不代表任何职责或权能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王”，呵。我嘲弄魔王的愚蠢，不仅仅是在嘲弄你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，这顶王冠本身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"曾充盈整片空间的红色已不复存在。\n\\n唯有一点赤红，从血魔大君的瞳孔里渗出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当萨卡兹们失去了可供仰赖的魔王，他们也许终会从这个苦等救赎的，卑怯的梦中醒来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我承认你说的，自深渊中觉醒的人将更加强大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正因如此，你们无法胜过我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹已经堕落的意志，怎么能抵挡曾承载提卡兹鲜血的我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肮脏无法污蔑纯洁，恶浊无法染指澄澈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提卡兹既是你们的来路，你们就只能在这条延长线上攀缘！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们才是反抗者！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我划定，即为我纠正。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“血与火将熄灭，正视灭亡。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Logos先生，小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一抹猩红凭空出现。\n\\n女妖曾占据的空间，被鲜血取代。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的血，对我，产生了影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比那些法阵强大数倍——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，多亏了你们，我也在这里流淌下了我的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也正因为如此——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里也被纳入了卡兹戴尔之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁能想到，当所有人都认为这片大地的全貌已经展露殆尽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家园的边界却仍在拓展。哪怕此时此地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹，我自称萨卡兹的同胞啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟上血液的行军，跟上永不会背叛你们的，血脉中的馈赠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会将你们带去，这一切的起点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那里会是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一道影子贯穿了他的胸膛。\n\\n血液组成的丝线在一瞬间被切断。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，萨卡兹的馈赠，与我无关。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你*萨卡兹粗口*又不是萨卡兹，动起来！削弱他的束缚！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在做！他的法术比想象中——更疯狂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我几乎听不见他的心声了，那里......那里只有一片猩红......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就要......抓住了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又一个异族......这倒是出乎意料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你鲜血的气息，你是卡普里尼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无趣的伪装......就让你的血绞死你自己吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们觉得凭这种粗浅的法术，就能够杀死一位萨卡兹的王庭之主？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"厚重的剑锋直指血魔大君的头颅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别把屠杀的陈词滥调称作“觉醒”，血魔大君。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还在仇恨和毁灭之中兜兜转转的你，从来没有离开过所谓的“深渊”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还没睡醒的，是你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——卑劣的叛徒——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是现在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趁他没有恢复以前，把他从骸骨上击落！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"挽歌声，于此刻奏响。\n女妖的呼啸编织为哀悼的旋律，脚下的浪潮亦为殇曲伴唱。\n\\n沉稳的男声轻和着丧钟的音韵，月光就是他的辞章。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"骨哨未奏自鸣。\n\\n它悠远的啸声，穿过时光，击中眼前殷红的王庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我刚践祚王庭时，丧钟已与我的命运相连。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都不能逃过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但挽歌哀悼的不会是你的身躯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而是与你我相连的一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血魔大君仍然挣扎着，鲜血从他的指尖涌出，宛若利爪，在巨兽苍白的颅骨上刻出一道道深深的划痕。\n\\n他的身体在哀歌中崩解，又重新以鲜血复原。\n\\n他是鲜血的象征，只要还有血，他就还会战斗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——不会——女妖——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，与我合奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去窥探挽歌的弦音。去寻觅女妖的起点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看向我。看向你曾捂耳避讳的哀嚎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们必须将他终结在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会尝试！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女妖的歌声再度唱响，旷古的钟声宛如凝成实质，震慑着血液的蠕行。\n\\n血魔仍在升起。\n\\n片刻后，一个稍显稚嫩的女声加入了悼曲的和声。\n死亡的宣言？否决的判词？\n\\n不是，也不止，乐曲之中徒有一种怯懦的情感，徒留......悲伤。\n\\n血液在冷却，月光变换。萨卡兹的仇恨并非无理，血魔的复仇并非无理。\n\\n只是，这绝非应许的将来。焦土之上，幸存者难道还有未来可言？\n不！\n\\n那对兄妹，到底......看到了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女妖！听听吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是——承应了你的血脉，我的赐福——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是，没有打败你自己！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"此处回荡的，已不再是挽歌。\n\\n只是叹息。\n\\n叹息却令他不安。\n爆炸的热浪和剑的重量第一次让大君感到力不从心。\n\\n他看向那小小的魔王。\n看向那只卡特斯，远不如萨卡兹的劣种。看向那顶黑王冠，毫无意义的诅咒。\n\\n他踩踏着的历史与幻象，血脉与传承，复仇与无匹的力量，都陡然消失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他感到脚下一空。\n身着白衣的人影自骸骨之上坠落。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_i06"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多可笑......就连众魂都在嘲弄我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"女妖之主，还有......“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你们把这些无视过去的驳杂者留在身边，在最后，你们甚至不敢自己动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......卑劣者，总是胜出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这确实是我们的诅咒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"异族的魔王处决了我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"魔王与丧钟共鸣。但你们却不知，血色的联系有多么坚韧，就妄图宣判......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你们最后，终于还是用出了血脉之中的力量！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"两位挽歌歌者同时为我献上悼亡曲——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们终归，还是敌不过构成你们一切的，来自血脉中的本能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们真的杀死了我吗？不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已经把提卡兹的血还给故乡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去看吧，去伦蒂尼姆看看——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（轻如耳语的萨卡兹语）我在毁灭的帷幕后等着你们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
